WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.586
Wuro ni furaburu ɲagaminin. O ye jamana kumakolon dɔ lo ye.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.900
A daminɛ na, suu dɔrɔn lo tun be yen. O kɔ, Wuro k'a boro fla majigi. Dugukolo yɛlɛnna.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.480
O kɔ, a ka tasuma cɛtigɛ k'a kɛ tere ye.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.570
O y'a to yiriw tun be falen. O kɔ, Danbaga Wuro sigira a ta dugukolo kura kan.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.338
Dugukolo tun cɛ ka ɲi, nka mɔgɔ si tun tɛ se k'a dɔndɔn. Wuro y'a kunbiri gwan k'a ka boon lɔ.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.618
O kɔ, cɛ dɔ bɔra o kɔnɔ ka bɔ. A y'a janto a yɛrɛ bolow la ani k'a Danbaga filɛ.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.730
Wuro ye tasuma don a la. O kɔ, a ka dingɛ dɔ lɔ, k'a kininboro gbasi.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:07.934
Adamaden ka mɔgɔ dɔ bugɔ; o kɔ, sanbɛrɛw wurira. Sanbɛrɛ fɔlɔ nana woro. A tun ye nɛgɛba baarakɛla ye.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:19.434
O boonw bɛɛ tun lɔra kelen kelen. Wuro y'a bolow dayɛlɛ, mɔgɔ wɛrɛw bɔra dugu kɔnɔ.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.018
Kɛrɛkɛcɛ ye dɔ di u bɛɛ kelen kelen ma. O bɛɛ ye sɛnɛ kɛ, ka siman sɔrɔ.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:44.378
Wuro tun ninsɔndiyanin lo a ka baara kosɔn. O kɔ, a tagara sankolo la.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.500
Nka ni Wuro tun tɛ yen, mɔgɔw tun be ɲinɛ o kɔ joona.

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:57.600
I ka kan k'i yɛrɛ minɛ, foro nin ye ne ta ye.

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:59.444
I ka foro be ban pewu!

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:13.580
O kɔ, buguriba dɔ ye dugu lamini. O kɔ, a y'a ka boon sanfɛla bɔ. Deen dɔ kasira.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:22.392
O suu nin na, nɛgɛbaara tun tora a kelen a ka nɛgɛbaaradugu kɔrɔ.

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:28.900
Wuro ! Cɛɛw y'a daminɛ ka fara ɲɔgɔn kan. I ka ne jaabi!

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.824
Lolo dɔ wurira, ka yɛlɛ yiri saninman kan.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:42.858
Nɛgɛtigɛbaga donna o yɔrɔ ra. A kɛra ten, Wuro tun be yen.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:58.346
Wuro y'a bolow kɔrɔta ka taga yiriba kɔrɔ. O yiriborow benna ka kɛ fani ye, ka fani dɔ biri a kun na.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:02.900
A magara a ra; o tun ye a dencɛ Dwo le ye.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:07.154
Ne dencɛ filɛ nin ye. E, nɛgɛbaarabaga, i k'a ta.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:16.274
Dwo y'a yɛrɛ kunbiri gwan ani a kɛra fani ye tugun. Nɛgɛtigɛbaga y'a mina a boro.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:21.306
I ka taga. I k'a fɔ u ye ko u ka taga.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:27.306
Wuro yɛlɛla sankolo la. O kɔ, a y'a latigɛ ka taga.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:39.050
Dugu gwɛra tuma min na, a tɛmɛna boon dɔ kɔfɛ. Yiribolow tun be yɛrɛyɛrɛla boon sanfɛ.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.082
"Dwo" bɔra. O dugumɔgɔw siranna.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:51.192
Nka Cɛkɔrɔba wurira ka Wuro dencɛ lɔn, k'a kinbiri gban.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.608
Dwo ye dɔn kɛ, dugumɔgɔw y'a bolow gosi.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:13.194
O kɔ, a k'a ka furaburuw yuguyugu ɲɔgɔn cɛ. O ka o boro fla biri dugu ma, ka ɲɔgɔn dɛmɛ.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:23.090
Sanfɔɲɔba kɔsegira. Dwo nana a ɲa, a bolow dayɛlɛra, fɔɲɔba banna.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:35.930
A kɛra ten, mɔgɔ waga kelen bɔra dugu kɔnɔ. Dugu mɔgɔw bɛɛ tun bɛ dɔn kɛ ni Dwo ye.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:53.250
Loon dɔ sufɛ, Dwo kɔsegira yiritu kɔnɔ. A kɛra ten, nɛgɛtigɛbɔbaga kelen le bɔra.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:05:01.900
K'a ta o lon na, n'o koo tun ma diya an ye tugun, an tun be to k'an ka furaburuw bɔ.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.000
O kɔ, lolo dɔ be sanfɛ.
